// Dialog :
"P3439391270" "<color orange>Hammond smiles at you as you approach.</color><br><br>You have returned to me, {Hero.gender=male brother|sister}. Can I assume, then, that you have come seeking more of the Truth?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - StartTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2285610961" "What do you have in mind, {Hero.gender=male brother|sister}?"
// Answer Text :
"P4269442820" "I can show you, soon... can you gather together as many followers as possible?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3535417625" "If you believe it is necessary, then we can have tonight's sermon here, in the territory of the enemy.<br><br><color orange>Hammond's expression turns skeptical.</color><br><br>I do hope that whatever you plan on showing us is related to our struggle against Aeon. I would be displeased if we were wasting time on trivial matters."
// Answer Text :
"P1341821734" "Trust me, you'll like this. (Start Mission)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HammondTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page WhyHere Text :
"P2771234259" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_BrotherHammond width=128 height=128>Alright, {Hero.gender=male brother|sister} {HeroName}. I have gathered our priory here, at your request. What is it that you wish us to see?"
// Answer Text :
"P14392939" "The forces of evil are here, brother. I plan to stand against them."
// Page Waiting Text :
"P1353535171" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_BrotherHammond width=128 height=128>This place swarms with the agents of corruption. We should depart quickly."
// Answer Text :
"P3455026186" "Truth does not hide, brother. I will strike them down myself."
// Page Savior Text :
"P2439454256" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_BrotherHammond width=128 height=128><color orange>Brother Hammond looks at you quizzically.</color><br><br>Impressive, {Hero.gender=male brother|sister}, but I don't understand why you called us out here. Your abilities are potent indeed, but they cannot stop Aeon's madness alone. Granted, you were able to defeat three of his lieutenants, but...<br><br><color orange>Hammond trails off as realization dawns on his face. His jaw drops and he stares at you incredulously.</color><br><br>Three... three evils defeated..."
// Answer Text :
"P3576562449" "Yes...?"
// Page Savior2 Text :
"P2686919899" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_BrotherHammond width=128 height=128><color orange>Hammond looks around him in awe, then turns back to you.</color><br><br>In the <i>very heart of darkness</i>. The center of the corruption! Here, Aeon City, the crowning achievement of the mad Dr. Aeon! I... I have a hard time believing this, {Hero.gender=male brother|sister}, but... but it all makes sense!<br><br><i>Risen from the shadows</i>... how could I have been such a fool? Of course the Chosen One would be one of your, ah... <i>questionable</i> background. This... this is it! We are living in times long prophesied!<br><br>You, {HeroName}... great and humble {Hero.gender=male brother|sister} of our order... I believe you are the Chosen One.<br><br><color orange>Brother Hammond bows his head to you solemnly."
// Answer Text :
"P3425424022" "Fantastic deduction, brother. I'm glad you have seen the... 'truth'."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P685163576" "<color orange>Hammond assumes a stuffy, condescending posture and begins pacing in front of you.</color><br><br>I believe it is time that I related to you the history of our order. When Martin Henri, the great prophet, was first visited by the spirit of his-"
// AcceptString :
"P822355812" "I'm sorry to interrupt, brother, but I have something important to show you."
// SendOffString :
"P3872982670" "<color orange>Hammond stops short, and raises a curious eyebrow at you.</color><br><br>Do you now? I am intrigued, {Hero.gender=male brother|sister}. Please explain."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3237986728" "Fulfill the Luddite Prophecy"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3085778512" "<color orange>Hammond greets you with a patient, condescending smile.</color><br><br>Gathering the followers of the Truth takes time, {Hero.gender=male brother|sister}. Please have some patience."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3693687477" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Choosing Oneself</color>"

