// 5 Actor3 :
"P1280834341" "Don't worry. If {Hero.gender=male he|she} shows, we'll catch {Hero.gender=male him|her}. We came well-prepared."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P1359308436" "Fan out and search. {HeroName} has to be here somewhere."
