"P941922685" "You took advantage of the Luddites' attack and staged a heist on the Cap au Diable bank!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1002953511" "<color orange>Hammond is smiling broadly. When he sees you, he waves gleefully and beckons you closer.</color><br><br>It is done! Oh, I thought this day would never come. The day of prophecy, the moment of our foretold victory!<br><br>Praise be to you, Chosen One! You are the light that drives away the darkness!"
// RandomFameString :
"P518662881" "Is it true that {HeroName} joined the Luddites? I thought {Hero.gender=male he|she} was smarter than that..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HammondTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1628523086" "What's wrong, {Hero.gender=male brother|sister}? You seem displeased. Are you not proud of the progress we have achieved? Progress that you, the Chosen One, have made possible?"
// Answer Text :
"P3136585536" "...Sure. Proud. You said that Martin Henri's attacking the PTS right now?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4102297266" "Yes indeed! Brother Henri was so inspired by your bold course, attacking the very veins through which the corruption is spread, that he ordered the entire city be freed. The paltry defenses that Aeon has installed at the power station will be no match for-<br><br><color orange>Hammond is cut off mid-sentence as the entire city goes dark. Hammond flashes you a knowing smile.</color><br><br>I must spread the good news to our brothers, elsewhere in the city. Rejoice, {Hero.gender=male brother|sister}, for today we are victorious!"
// Answer Text :
"P3635176212" "This can't be happening... (Start Mission)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - AeonTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Start Text :
"P3141997281" "<color orange>Dr. Aeon is in the middle of what looks like a furious, barely-controlled tantrum. When you approach, he glares at you from under his goggles, teeth clenched tight.</color><br><br>Do you have <b><i>ANY</b></i> idea what you have done? You have <i>sabotaged</i> my city, <i>subjected</i> the area to <i>demonic rampages</i>, and worst of all, you have <b><i>humiliated</b></i> me in the eyes of Lord Recluse. And all for some <b><i>petty cash</b></i>?<br><br>I should KILL you for this!"
// Answer Text :
"P3688203232" "So far, all I'm hearing is talk, Aeon."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2960082392" "<color orange>An angry red vein protrudes from Aeon's forehead. He slowly raises his arm and presses a button on the chestpiece of his powered armor. An automated voice begins emitting from small speakers built into the armor:</color><br><br><color yellow>COMBAT SUIT V-93 ONLINE. ALERT - 3% POWER REMAINING. ALL NONESSENTIAL SYSTEMS HAVE BEEN SHUT DOWN. RECHARGE THIS UNIT'S POWER SUPPLY TO REACTIVATE NONESSENTIAL SYSTEMS.</color><br><br>As you can see, I'm in a bit of a bind. Charging my suit would be no problem, but <b><i>SOMEONE</b></i> gathered a bunch of filthy rubes and <i>assaulted</i> my <b><i>POWER STATION</b></i>!"
// Answer Text :
"P2501047460" "That sounds like quite the predicament."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3089430047" "<color orange>Aeon scowls at you.</color><br><br>Yes. <i>Quite</i>.<br><br>So, you see, I am currently unable to handle the Luddite problem directly. I find myself in need of someone... <i>capable</i>... to handle the problem for me."
// Answer Text :
"P3976304523" "For the right price, I could be that someone."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P3188641343" "You... you want me to <b><i>pay</i></b> you... to clean up your own mess? Of all the...<br><br><color orange>Dr. Aeon chokes on his own rage for a moment, before recovering enough to be coherent again.</color><br><br>...Alright, {HeroName}. You... have yourself a deal. Even though by all rights I should be <b><i>rearranging your skeletal system</b></i> right now, I will... <i>hire</i> you... to stop the Luddites and reactivate the Power Transfer System.<br><br>Board my flier. It will take you to the appropriate location. Now get out of my sight."
// Answer Text :
"P2521918009" "Pleasure doing business with you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BrassTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Start Text :
"P3980933599" "Glad to see you here, {HeroName}. The Luddites have entrenched themselves pretty deep, and have managed to repel most of our incursions thus far. Their rank-and-file don't seem to be very coordinated or disciplined, but their leader has exhibited powers on a scale that our operatives can't match.<br><br>Dr. Aeon has asked that I support you in this mission. I'll be joining you in the PTS."
// Answer Text :
"P986708825" "Glad to have the help."
// Answer Text :
"P85715986" "That won't be necessary, Marshal. I prefer to work alone."
// Page Refuse Text :
"P2449412615" "As you wish. Good luck in there, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HammondFinishTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Start Text :
"P1053044595" "<color orange>Hammond greets you with an ominous glare.</color><br><br>I have nothing to say to you, <i>traitor</i>. You may have seduced my faith with your false words, but I am not fool enough to allow you to do it again."
// Answer Text :
"P2302917210" "It was *your* prophecy, Hammond. I just took an opportunity where I saw one."
// Answer Text :
"P2296293388" "Are you serious? You realize you've been helping a *demon*, right?"
// Page Opportunity Text :
"P466205546" "Your petty 'opportunity' has cost the people of this island dearly. With Aeon's technology back in power, the citizens are once more enthralled.<br><br><color orange>Hammond glowers at you.</color><br><br>It is clear to me that the forces working against us are too powerful for our order to confront directly. With Brother Henri missing, it falls to me to guide our order down a new path. <br><br>The prophecies are true, {HeroName}, and the consequences of inaction would be dire indeed. As our order evolves, perhaps one day you will see the value in our quest. I hope, for your sake, that you do."
// Answer Text :
"P3910541018" "Please, save your sanctimony. I'm leaving."
// Page Demon Text :
"P349609617" "Brother Henri may have acted erratically in the moments before his disappearance, but I can assure you that our order is free of such influence. The might of our order is clearly not enough to compete with its foes... for now. It is my intention to change this.<br><br>Our order will be made anew, {HeroName}. We shall grow stronger, and once we have gathered our might, we will sweep across the world and spread the Truth. Our cries will echo across nations, and when our armies descend to rid the world of demonic filth shrouded as 'progress', our foes will tremble in fear.<br><br><color orange>Hammond stares at you, wide-eyed. For an instant, he looks more like Martin Henri than the mild-mannered Luddite you've come to expect.</color><br><br>When we have changed, {HeroName}, pray that we do not meet again. Your penance will not be pleasant."
// Answer Text :
"P3561823687" "Yes, well, good luck with all that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P131132239" "Finally, the empire of Aeon has crumbled! Their blessed technology is useless to them, and all of Aeon City has been plunged into darkness! Praise be to-"
// AcceptString :
"P3709834201" "Whoa, hold on. All of Aeon City?"
// SendOffString :
"P12664348" "Yes! Inspired by your leadership, our brothers have gone to the very heart of the corruption! Martin Henri himself leads them now, to assault the PTS and end Aeon's reign of technological tyranny!<br><br>Rejoice, {Hero.gender=male brother|sister}, for today, we shall save the troubled peoples of this place from the corruption that surrounds them!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2683014957" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: Traitor by Trade</color>"

