"P1134195518" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor red>YOU HAVE DEFEATED MY SPAWN, BUT WHEN I ARISE I SHALL-<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkblue>Confound it, beast, will you shut UP for one second?!?<t=6 caption x= 0.6 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkblue> {HeroName}, this is Dr. Aeon. I *know* that you're responsible for this, so don't bother trying to flee. I would have words with you."

